  "2026-11-16T00:43:03.223Z",codex-sol,"Final local evidence: 96/96 touched identity/coverage-harness tests passed in 8.95 seconds at scale 3; final generated-count diagnostics passed 2/2 in 11.06 seconds. Source typecheck, build, test typecheck, lint, changelog, unchanged publish-attestation verifier, clean-HOME strict health and strict YAML/matrix checks passed. One optional quick coverage attempt was stopped after 983 seconds in the gate (16m23s), still in early controller fault matrices, because it could not plausibly complete inside the 20-minute shared-host budget. No failure had been reported before termination; this is incomplete coverage evidence, not a pass. Full depth was not run locally. Current code CI run 43781112285 has both required checks still running, so completed PR wall times are unavailable. Full baseline hosted times remain 79m58s / 60m14s / 63m23s. Risks: complete quick coverage, final PR duration under 30 minutes, and post-merge full local/Docker deep routing remain unverified. No reviews were answered, no item closed, and no merge or repository policy changes made."
