  "2026-11-16T02:36:34.574Z",codex-sol,"Cancelled run 43789664325 jobs API: Node 22 created-to-completed 1628s, execution 1626s, engines step 1599s; Node 26 1626s, execution 1624s, release step 1603s. Node 22 exposed three spawnSync pm ENOENT failures because direct Node lost npm local-bin PATH; explicit package-local PATH restores CLI resolution in an isolated shell, and 38/38 workflow contracts pass. Four instrumented workers progressed only to card recovery in 26 minutes versus the earlier two-worker run reaching transfer suites near 30 minutes; retaining two coverage workers, four uninstrumented engines workers. Final harness tests pass 65/65; typecheck, test typecheck, lint, zero duplicates, changelog and strict health pass. Five full touched files passed 285 tests, 1 intentional deep-only skip, 0 failures in 2848.564s; final stronger recovery superset is still running. Next fresh CI costs: snapshots 172.915/150.123s (Node 22/26), shared-tracker 149.649/122.422s, HTTP receipt crash sweep 142.225/121.046s, main corpus 140.585/119.553s, refused vector retries 105.326/101.283s. Target duration and final quick coverage remain unproven."
