  "2026-11-16T03:05:18.515Z",codex-sol,"Final bounded CI observation at 2026-11-16 03:05:13 UTC for implementation 054c023d54ea7fa3f11d5ed9858a2189c77d4f1b, run https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/actions/runs/43793233716 . test (22): in_progress/None; test (26): completed/failure. The <=15-minute target is missed. Completed gate durations and all-four-dimension quick coverage remain unverified while jobs run. Jobs API observed step wall times:\n\n| Step | Node 22 (s) | Node 26 (s) |\n| --- | ---: | ---: |\n| Set up job | 0 | 1 |\n| Checkout | 3 | 3 |\n| Detect code changes | 0 | 0 |\n| Setup Node.js | 3 | 7 |\n| Setup Bun | 1 | 1 |\n| Install dependencies | 9 | 3 |\n| Verify tracked pm project health | skipped | 2 |\n| Check documentation and tracker changes | skipped | skipped |\n| Engines floor tests | running (~1671 s) | skipped |\n| Quick npm release gate | pending | 1584 |\n| Verify Bun can install the package graph | pending | skipped |\n| Post Setup Bun | pending | skipped |\n| Post Setup Node.js | pending | skipped |\n| Post Checkout | pending | 0 |\n| Complete job | not reached | 0 |\n\nLater Bun/post steps have not been reached. Next-slowest completed-log ranking remains snapshots, shared-tracker interleavings, HTTP receipt SIGKILL sweep, origin-main corpus and vector retries (recorded above). Local proof: five whole touched files 285 pass / 1 intentional deep skip / zero fail; final recovery superset 35 cases / 36 tests passed in 768.207s; harness 65/65 and workflow contracts 38/38. Source/test typecheck, lint, zero duplicates, changelog, isolated strict health, identity/docstring/attestation/YAML and isolated CLI PATH checks pass. Full matrices and product contracts remain unchanged. Releasing without closing. Final docs/tracker receipt is committed locally, left unpushed to avoid superseding the running implementation checks; the public PR body carries the same measurements. No merge or review-thread action performed."
  "2026-11-16T03:46:10.895Z",pi-glm,"Coverage fix and quick-tier timing work. Coverage: added a deterministic LM Compose controller drill in test/lm-compose.test.ts that runs the real durable loop with the compose-lm adapter; only the container runtime is a PATH-injected stand-in whose compose run executes the packaged process-lm-trainer.ts entrypoint, so no Docker daemon is needed. It reaches the external process trainer fit path (index.ts 4557-4558 plus its durable verify call) and exercises verifyLmProcessJob success, missing-receipt and digest-drift refusals (process-lm.ts 60-64) at every depth. Thresholds and ignores unchanged. Sampling: new testKindCases helper in test/support/depth.ts keeps one representative of every declared kind at quick depth and stays exhaustive at full depth, with contract tests in test/depth.test.ts. Applied to the remaining full enumerations: durable-snapshot corruption receipt sweep (legacy, first and latest cycle receipts at quick), HTTP-to-PM receipt SIGKILL stages (every crash stage kind and both decision metrics without all 8 combinations), refused-vector boundary crashes (phase crash kind once; the durable-loop phase sweep already covers collect/train/evaluate crash points at quick), and the generated SDK chronology inversions (one inversion per artifact-class pair per shape). Job shape: Node 22 quick tests now run in a non-required quick-shard (22, 1/2) matrix via node --test --test-shard, and the required test (22) check is an always() aggregate that needs the shards and fails unless every shard succeeded; docs/tracker PRs keep the same health, changelog, audit, pack and docs-input contracts in the aggregate. test (26) is unchanged. Local verification on the shared host: typecheck, test typecheck, lint, duplicates, docstring, changelog check and identity audit passed; touched tests passed at quick depth: depth contracts 4/4, LM Compose controller drill (new), HTTP receipt replay, refused vector retries 6/6, chronology witnesses, immutable snapshot corruption property; workflow and release contract tests 36/36. Hosted CI timing and coverage results are pending from the pushed run."
  "2026-11-16T03:49:09.631Z",pi-glm,"Pushed head 9c4a511 (worktree branch ci/quick-pr-tier-deep-local-tier, ahead of the prior unpushed receipt commit 6a9e94f which is included). CI run 43800153216 started at 03:46:33Z with quick-shard (22, 1), quick-shard (22, 2) and test (26) running; the required test (22) aggregate waits on the shards. Hosted per-job and per-step wall times will be recorded from the jobs API after completion; observation is bounded to 30 minutes after this last push."
