  "2026-11-16T04:27:25.742Z",codex-sol,"Implementation: Node 26 coverage has four file shards, two instrumentation workers each, original V8 function/block hit artifacts, then Node-native raw-report replay plus the existing source-presence and statement checks. Fixture proves identical LCOV and statement totals to unsharded execution, including disjoint branch/function coverage, relocated checkout URLs, and failure on a missing shard. Required test (26) is always() and fails closed over shard matrix, merge and parallel release checks. Quick jobs have a 22-minute cap, target <=15 minutes; four shards project approximately eight minutes from the previous >29-minute test lower bound, subject to file imbalance. Local release:check and CI Deep unchanged. Docs/tracker path uses pack inspection without lifecycle scripts and lightweight workflow/identity/changelog/health contracts so it does not compile; full packed/documentation input suites remain in code/deep runs. Thread PRRT_kwDOTqJmqs63vkcK: copy test/support and assert the disposable test imports; PRRT_kwDOTqJmqs63vkcO: bind operation/sequence summaries to actual sampled loop limits. No thread interaction. Source/test typechecks, lint, duplicates, docstring, identity and changelog checks passed; workflow/coverage/release contracts passed 103/103 before the final CLI-mode coverage probes. Touched integration tests are running through pm test."
  "2026-11-16T04:29:08.669Z",codex-sol,"Final focused harness passed through pm test: 104/104, zero failures/skips. Instrumenting coverage-gate.ts alone measured 855/855 lines, 176/176 branches and 20/20 functions before the final diagnostic-LCOV copy addition; the fixture also matches statement totals exactly. Raw-hit artifacts include shard LCOV for explicit line/branch/function diagnostics; merge uses original V8 reports rather than shard percentages. Strict tracker health passed with only pre-existing advisory findings. Previous run 43800153216 exact jobs API execution times: quick-shard (22, 1) 904 s success; quick-shard (22, 2) 657 s success; test (22) 10 s success; test (26) 1815 s cancelled. Current touched integration suites remain running; no package-wide coverage claim yet."
  "2026-11-16T04:29:59.959Z",codex-sol,"Touched-suite run through the default pm test schema sandbox failed because injected PM_PATH redirected a fixture initializer into the pre-seeded tracker (init_existing_settings_requires_force). The sampled identity test completed and printed canonical_sequences=50. Retrying the same linked command with pm-context none so fixtures own their temporary trackers; this is an execution-context correction, not a product change."
  "2026-11-16T04:30:55.993Z",codex-sol,"The no-context pm test retry was refused before execution because pm_context_mode=none requires an isolated/snapshot workspace. Running the exact linked integration command directly instead, preserving source-workspace fidelity and avoiding injected PM_PATH. The mandatory pm test execution is recorded above; its 104-test harness command passed, while the integration wrapper failure is a sandbox collision."
  "2026-11-16T04:34:24.025Z",codex-sol,"The final shard/merge and CLI-mode fixtures also pass on Node 26.13.0 (2/2), matching the hosted coverage runtime. Source/test typechecks and lint pass after the final artifact diagnostic change. Explicit-path staging contains only the workflow, coverage gate and fixtures, both review fixes, CI tier documentation, and this item's task/history pair."
  "2026-11-16T04:35:42.081Z",codex-sol,"Direct execution of the linked touched-suite command passed 115/115, zero failures, skips or cancellations: PM_TEST_DEPTH=quick PM_TEST_DOCKER=off node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/mutation-preflight.test.ts test/controller-boundaries.test.ts test/training-influence.test.ts. Printed operations=50 and canonical_sequences=50 at quick depth. The wrapper sandbox collision and refused no-context wrapper remain separate receipts. Final local validation is complete; preparing the implementation push and bounded hosted observation."
  "2026-11-16T04:36:05.562Z",codex-sol,"Pushed implementation 829fef3017da0389a3a3cf745507e6ff3226f1a5 at 2026-11-16 04:35:45 UTC after checking the shared-runner hold and verifying that all branch commit author emails equal the approved bot address. Both supplied Greptile thread fixes are in that commit. PR body updated with job shape, local proof, previous jobs API times and the 05:05:45 UTC observation deadline. Waiting only within that bound for hosted job durations and merged package-wide coverage."
  "2026-11-16T04:45:58.149Z",codex-sol,"Hosted implementation run 43805065024 exposed an existing proof-producer source contract: evaluation-lifecycle-proof.test.ts forbids spawnSync in revert producers. Coverage shard 4 failed at 501 s solely on the new copy-import probe's spawnSync spelling; release-checks passed in 49 s and coverage shard 1 in 222 s. Replacing that probe with asserted execFileSync preserves the actual copied-test import check and the shared proveRevert admission path. Running proof/workflow contracts plus test typecheck/lint before the corrective push. Other first-run shards are still active; their eventual cancellations must not be counted as passes."
  "2026-11-16T04:46:13.476Z",codex-sol,"Corrective local proof passed: PM_TEST_DEPTH=quick node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/evaluation-lifecycle-proof.test.ts test/ci-workflow.test.ts (11/11, zero failures/skips), npm run build:test and npm run lint. Both copied-test import and existing proof-producer contracts pass with asserted execFileSync."
